00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:15,640
that you have reached your capacity to accept

37
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,500
or to do well on the boards you're

38
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:20,400
sitting on, do an audit and please drop

39
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,140
one or two.

40
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:24,820
You can recommend somebody else in your place.

41
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,300
If you've been sitting on the board for

42
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:30,880
a while and the board hasn't done an

43
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:34,920
assessment of its performance or your performance, feedback

44
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:37,780
is critical to your continued effectiveness.

45
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:41,520
So it's important to call the board's attention

46
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:44,180
