51
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:56,620
on how well you as a director have

52
00:01:56,620 --> 00:01:58,580
done and how well the board has done.

53
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:02,720
And more importantly, identify areas of gap that

54
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:06,340
